{"id":"657892","name":"木耳青椒炒肉","author":"开心肥羊","authorId":"389860","desc":"","cover":"images/657892/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"300g(菜椒)"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干木耳泡发洗净备用。","img":"images/657892/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青椒切块备用。","img":"images/657892/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头去皮切片备用。","img":"images/657892/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪肉切片，用少许生粉、生抽腌制20分钟。","img":"images/657892/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中倒入少许油，爆香蒜片。","img":"images/657892/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再下入肉片翻炒一下。","img":"images/657892/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入木耳、青椒，继续翻炒。","img":"images/657892/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒入盐、鸡粉。","img":"images/657892/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再撒入胡椒粉。","img":"images/657892/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"滴入少许生抽，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/657892/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后加半碗清水，盖锅盖小火焖煮5分钟即可。","img":"images/657892/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}